{"2415080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ultimate Chicken Fighter", "steam_appid": 2415080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>“Ultimate Chicken Fighter”</strong>, the RPG game about rooster battles where you fight to become the greatest rooster master in the world! Lead a team of unique roosters in exciting (or not-so-exciting) battles as you embark on a journey to become the best rooster master on the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in <strong>8 epic leagues</strong>, fight through the professional leagues, reach the podium at the world championship, and prove that you are the best of the best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>over 60 different roosters</strong>, each with their own unique abilities, you’ll need to capture and build your team to become champion — all while facing <strong>loan sharks, the government, and shady bar owners</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re looking for a <strong>unique fighting and rooster-collecting RPG experience</strong>, you’ve found it!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>“Ultimate Chicken Fighter”</strong>, the RPG game about rooster battles where you fight to become the greatest rooster master in the world! Lead a team of unique roosters in exciting (or not-so-exciting) battles as you embark on a journey to become the best rooster master on the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in <strong>8 epic leagues</strong>, fight through the professional leagues, reach the podium at the world championship, and prove that you are the best of the best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>over 60 different roosters</strong>, each with their own unique abilities, you’ll need to capture and build your team to become champion — all while facing <strong>loan sharks, the government, and shady bar owners</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re looking for a <strong>unique fighting and rooster-collecting RPG experience</strong>, you’ve found it!</p>", "short_description": "ULTIMATE CHICKEN FIGHTER, the rpg where you fight with your chickens to become the best in the world!", "supported_languages": "Portuguese - Brazil, English, Portuguese - Portugal", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2415080/9295457025f96275cd024955021d2e1a0f9078cc/header.jpg?t=1778235985", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2415080/98862f10cb8eb617d0b45b23e4b340957a2b9b82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778235985", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2415080/98862f10cb8eb617d0b45b23e4b340957a2b9b82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778235985", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core 2 duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Pandalf Studios"], "publishers": ["Pandalf Studios"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2415080/99d83dcf07590234d9f33112b1e6e3f80ba38da0/ss_99d83dcf07590234d9f33112b1e6e3f80ba38da0.600x338.jpg?t=1778235985", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2415080/99d83dcf07590234d9f33112b1e6e3f80ba38da0/ss_99d83dcf07590234d9f33112b1e6e3f80ba38da0.1920x1080.jpg?